message: "Please cite the manuscript and the software when using these results."
type: software
title: "A180206: exact enumeration through n=26"
version: "v1.0.2"
date-released: 2026-11-19
authors:
  - family-names: Corti
    given-names: Carlo
    email: carlo.corti@outlook.com
abstract: >-
  Exact counts of permutations of 0 through n-1 representable as consecutive
  sums of three adjacent nonnegative integers. Weighted subset enumeration
  and a modular inclusion-exclusion recount agree through n=26. Includes
  canonical data, the monolithic manuscript, sources, retained execution
  evidence and bounded validation tools.
